Package: cori.data.bps
Type: Package
Title: Access and Analyze U.S. Census Bureau Building Permits Survey Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Drew", "Rosebush", email = "drew.rosebush@ruralinnovation.us", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access and analyze U.S. Census Bureau Building Permits Survey (BPS)
    data covering new residential units authorized from 2000 to present. Provides
    tools to read source data from the Census Bureau, write raw and processed data
    to S3, and query processed data from S3 via DuckDB.
